# a stored clause of the read that does not read back refuses the write too
statement ok
ACL ADMIN GRANT CATALOG c TO ROLE analyst WITH (select) MAIN VERSIONS AT (VERSION => 2); REVOKE TABLE c.t FROM ROLE auditor; GRANT CATALOG c TO ROLE auditor WITH (delete) MAIN;

